<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.49 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.49 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Statistics Office released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES  * Sept	 Aug	 Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1990)	 116.86     116.50	 n/a</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	+0.31	+0.10	 n/a</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	  +1.49	+1.35	 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * prices as measured on the first of the following month.</p>
<p>Statec said price rises were mainly seen for oil products, for potatoes, and housing.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
